{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/9be221b16885fff8e8b32df4b77ea120.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei is on a journey to become a fully-fledged mage when her airship meets a terrible fate. She and her family crash land in Jupeterno and are nursed back to health by some locals... Except apparently once someone arrives in Jupeterno, they're never allowed to leave. Add in political intrigue and a mysterious, beautiful princess, and Rei's chances of ever making it home are crashing as rapidly as her airship did!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/0a81863e23517c0b3abfecd25d848a69.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle through a magical tower full of monsters to get what you need to escape the country... or give in and resign yourself to your fate. Which will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/9fa0556354efeef905e80dac01cc9545.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/385e0c8931fe36fccaa272f4978b826b.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/e931363bdc5231eb608dcf70dd977a61.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/2ad6d545547f9643665c6602f768e87d.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/extras/deb2dd597b78b9c4faf3f0b3aa085517.avif?t=1766500695\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Find your way home</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak to locals and investigate Jupeterno to find a way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Turn-based combat Battle</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > menacing monsters to build up your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hand Drawn Art</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There are plenty of unique, hand-drawn images for you to collect and enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Different Endings to Uncover</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's multiple ways this journey could end. Can you do what's needed to uncover them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721960?t=1766500695","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721960?t=1766500695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/bc7633708fe1e90c4bb9fe6850028313d09c1174/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766500695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721960/bc7633708fe1e90c4bb9fe6850028313d09c1174/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766500695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c